---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { vgenProducts } from '../../data/products';
---

<Layout
  title="Katalog Produk Genset Portable V-GEN — Gensetora Indonesia"
  description="Katalog resmi genset portable open type V-GEN bensin kapasitas 2.200 Watt hingga 8.500 Watt (1 Phase 220V & 3 Phase 380V). Unit baru bergaransi resmi distributor Rajawali Diesel."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-20 sm:pt-24 bg-[#F3F6FA]">
    
    <!-- Hero / Header Banner -->
    <section class="bg-[#101C2B] text-white py-14 sm:py-20 border-b border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        
        <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#F5B82E] transition-colors">Beranda</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span class="text-[#F5B82E]">Katalog Produk</span>
          <span>/</span>
          <span class="text-white">Genset Portable V-GEN</span>
        </nav>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end justify-between gap-8">
          <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#F5B82E]/10 border border-[#F5B82E]/30 text-[#F5B82E] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              Resmi Rajawali Diesel Indonesia (RDI)
            </div>
            <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
              Katalog Genset Portable Open Type V-GEN
            </h1>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Jajaran genset bensin portable open-frame bertenaga 2.200 W hingga 8.500 W. Dilengkapi sistem dual starter elektrik &amp; recoil, alternator kawat tembaga murni, sasis pipa baja kokoh, dan tangki besar 25 Liter.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Download Action -->
          <div class="shrink-0">
            <a
              href="/downloads/brosur-vgen-portable-open-type.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              download
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-[#F5B82E] hover:bg-[#E5A71D] text-[#101C2B] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider shadow-lg transition-all"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
              </svg>
              <span>Download Brosur Resmi PDF (3.7 MB)</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Product Grid Section -->
    <section class="py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        
        <div class="mb-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 pb-5">
          <div>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#101C2B]">
              Daftar Unit Genset V-GEN Portable Ready Stock
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">
              Menampilkan {vgenProducts.length} pilihan model genset bensin portable dari seri VG 3500 LX hingga VG 12500 LX.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">
            <span>Standar Garansi Resmi</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400">•</span>
            <span>Uji Beban 100% Sebelum Kirim</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5 Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          {vgenProducts.map((p) => (
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#F5B82E] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
              <div>
                
                <!-- Image Header -->
                <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50/60 border-b border-slate-100 relative">
                  {p.badge && (
                    <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 z-10">
                      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#101C2B] text-[#F5B82E] text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase">
                        {p.badge}
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  )}
                  <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 z-10">
                    <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-[11px] font-bold">
                      {p.voltage}
                    </span>
                  </div>

                  <a href={`/produk/${p.slug}/`} class="block aspect-square max-w-[280px] mx-auto overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
                    <img
                      src={p.image}
                      alt={p.name}
                      class="w-full h-full object-contain filter drop-shadow-md"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="400"
                      height="400"
                    />
                  </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Body Info -->
                <div class="p-6 space-y-4">
                  <div>
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">
                      {p.brand} • {p.type}
                    </span>
                    <h3 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-xl text-[#101C2B] group-hover:text-[#E5A71D] transition-colors leading-snug mt-1">
                      <a href={`/produk/${p.slug}/`}>
                        {p.model}
                      </a>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed">
                      {p.shortDesc}
                    </p>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Spec Grid -->
                  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs pt-2">
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                      <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase block font-medium">Output Maksimum</span>
                      <strong class="text-slate-900 font-extrabold text-sm text-[#101C2B]">{p.maxOutput}</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                      <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase block font-medium">Output Kontinyu</span>
                      <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-sm">{p.ratedOutput}</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                      <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase block font-medium">Kapasitas Tangki</span>
                      <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">{p.fuelTank}</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                      <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase block font-medium">Starter</span>
                      <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-[11px]">Dual Starter</strong>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Dimensions & Weight -->
                  <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500">
                    <span>Dimensi: <strong class="text-slate-700">{p.dimensions}</strong></span>
                    <span>Berat: <strong class="text-slate-700">{p.weight}</strong></span>
                  </div>
                </div>

              </div>

              <!-- Footer CTA -->
              <div class="p-6 pt-0 space-y-2">
                <a
                  href={`https://wa.me/6285183005070?text=${encodeURIComponent(`Halo Gensetora, saya tertarik menanyakan harga dan spesifikasi teknis ${p.name} (${p.maxOutput}). Mohon informasinya.`)}`}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-3 px-4 rounded-lg bg-[#101C2B] hover:bg-[#F5B82E] hover:text-[#101C2B] text-white text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase transition-colors"
                >
                  <span>Minta Penawaran Unit</span>
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
                  </svg>
                </a>
                <a
                  href={`/produk/${p.slug}/`}
                  class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2 px-4 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:text-[#101C2B] text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide transition-colors"
                >
                  Detail &amp; Lembar Spesifikasi &rarr;
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Section -->
        <div class="mt-20 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-12">
          <div class="max-w-2xl mb-8">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[#101C2B]">
              Pertanyaan Seputar Genset Portable V-GEN
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">
              Informasi teknis penting yang sering ditanyakan sebelum memilih tipe genset bensin portable.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">
            <div class="space-y-2 p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-[#101C2B] text-sm">Berapa jam genset V-GEN bisa beroperasi dengan tangki 25 Liter?</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Dengan tangki bensin penuh 25 Liter dan beban operasional rata-rata 50%–75%, genset seri VG 3500 LX – VG 7500 LX dapat beroperasi terus-menerus selama 8 hingga 12 jam tanpa henti.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-[#101C2B] text-sm">Apa maksud dari sistem "Dual Starter"?</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Unit dilengkapi starter elektrik (cukup putar kunci starter instan tanpa tenaga) didukung aki bawaan, serta tetap memiliki recoil starter (tali tarikan manual) sebagai cadangan jika aki sedang lemah.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-[#101C2B] text-sm">Kapan harus memilih VG 12500 LX 3-Phase?</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Pilih model VG 12500 LX jika Anda memiliki beban mesin industri atau motor 3 fasa (380V), seperti pompa submersible besar, kompresor 3-phase, atau mesin bengkel. Varian ini juga memiliki socket 220V untuk beban 1 fasa standar.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-[#101C2B] text-sm">Bagaimana dukungan purna jual dan suku cadang?</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Setiap unit V-GEN didistribusikan resmi oleh Rajawali Diesel Indonesia (RDI) melalui Gensetora, dengan garansi pabrik, ketersediaan suku cadang fast-moving (karburator, busi, AVR, filter), dan dukungan tim mekanik berpengalaman.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
